graph TD
    A[Low Glucose Levels] --> B[Gluconeogenesis Induction]
    B --> C[Pyruvate Carboxylase]
    C --> D[Oxaloacetate Formation]
    D --> E[PEP Carboxykinase]
    E --> F[PEP Formation]
    F --> G[Gluconeogenic Enzymes]
    G --> H[Fructose-1,6-Bisphosphatase]
    H --> I[Fructose-6-Phosphate]
    I --> J[Glucose-6-Phosphatase]
    J --> K[Glucose Production]
    K --> L[Gluconeogenesis Complete]
    
    %% Alternative substrates
    A --> M[Lactate Entry]
    M --> N[Lactate Dehydrogenase]
    N --> O[Pyruvate Formation]
    O --> C
    
    %% Regulation
    L --> P[Glucose Levels]
    P --> Q{Glucose Sufficient?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Gluconeogenesis Inhibition]
    Q -->|No| S[Gluconeogenesis Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    T[Pyruvate Carboxylase] --> C
    U[PEP Carboxykinase] --> E
    V[Fructose-1,6-Bisphosphatase] --> H
    W[Glucose-6-Phosphatase] --> J
    X[Lactate Dehydrogenase] --> N
    Y[Oxaloacetate] --> D
    Z[PEP] --> F
    AA[Glucose] --> K
    
